  unitName: Sacred Advocate Rinon
  unitId: 50735
  unitNumber: 964
  description: After having relinquished her candidacy for the position of Oracle
    Maiden to one of her good friends, Rinon continued on her journey of learning
    without a real purpose to her life. While wondering the lands the man who had
    become Oracle Knight approached her, asking her to lend a hand in defeating a
    god who sought to destroy the human race. Rinon was furious at the thought that
    this man had rendered her other friend's dreams of becoming Oracle Knight fruitless,
    but she ended up accepting his invitation anyway. Perhaps she was just searching
    for someone who needed her.
  summonDesc: Is it wrong to live without purpose?<br>Living in itself is admirable.<br>That's
    why I'm not ashamed.
  fusionDesc: No need to push myself, right?<br>From now on I'll do as I like<br>and
    make up for what I missed out.
  evoDesc: Effort makes you stronger.<br>But I can't see anything beyond that.<br>What
    will you show me?
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
